  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{69E176FCDA351DC9}" {
   m_sTitle "Mission: Situation"
   m_sTextData "ION looks to move their current operations to a new FOB (OP Restrepo) in the Kunar region. Local insurgent forces wish they would leave."\
   ""\
   "BLUFOR Composition: Mechanized Infantry"\
   "BLUFOR Assets: 1x UH60 / 3x M1025s / 1x Command Truck"\
   ""\
   "OPFOR Composition: Motorized Infantry"\
   "OPFOR Assets: ATVs / Gun Trucks / Bomb vests"\
   ""\
   "Time: 2200"\
   ""\
   "Weather: Pissing down rain"
   m_aFactionKeys {
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 1
  }
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{69E176FCDA351E08}" {
   m_sTitle "BLUFOR Briefing"
   m_sTextData "MISSION"\
   "- Retain control of >20% of your forces"\
   "- Transport the Command Truck to OP Restrepo"\
   ""\
   "INTENT"\
   "You should utilize your assets and technological advantages to stunt the insurgents' assault."\
   "NOTE: Destruction of the Command Truck, by either side, will count as a loss for that side."\
   ""\
   "EXECUTION"\
   "Recon/communication between the platoon and the UH60 will be  extremely important"
   m_aFactionKeys {
    "BLUFOR"
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{69E176FCDA35198D}" {
   m_sTitle "OPFOR Briefing"
   m_sTextData "MISSION"\
   "- Destroy 80% of ION forces."\
   "- Take the Command Truck for yourselves"\
   ""\
   "INTENT"\
   "You have been outfitted with suicide vests and motorcycles; utilize these as you see fit. "\
   "NOTE: Destruction of the Command Truck, by either side, will count as a loss for that side."\
   ""\
   "EXECUTION"\
   "There are two platoons and two mountain ranges that flank either side of the MSR leading to ION's goal, if you know what I mean. Be strong.."
   m_aFactionKeys {
    "OPFOR"
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{69E176FCDA351914}" {
   m_sTitle "Administration"
   m_sTextData "NOTE: Destruction of the Command Truck, by either side, will count as a loss for that side."
   m_aFactionKeys {
    "BLUFOR"
    "OPFOR"
    "INDFOR"
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{69E176FBA0CCCDA8}" {
